This licence covers the code in code/ and the page scripts. The data files in
data/ and the text and figures are released under CC BY 4.0. They are derived
from: Wikidata (CC0 1.0); Wikimedia page views (CC0 1.0); Office for National
Statistics built-up areas 2022, Census 2021 and lookups (Open Government
Licence v3.0); National Records of Scotland, population estimates for
settlements and localities, mid-2020 ((c) Crown copyright, Open Government
Licence v3.0); NISRA Census 2021 table CT0100 ((c) Crown copyright, Open
Government Licence v3.0); OS Open Names (contains OS data (c) Crown copyright
and database right 2026, Open Government Licence v3.0). Please keep these
credits when reusing the data. The data files hold counts per town; the only
people named are the single most famous and most read person born in each
town, all public figures with Wikipedia articles.
